# clang-tidy-18 configuration for rvcl.
#
# Baseline (clang++-18 compile database, 2026-10): a full bugprone-/cert-/
# readability- sweep yields ~591 findings, of which ~500 are pervasive style
# noise in this C-ABI runtime library. We keep the high-signal checks and
# exclude the categories below, each with its reason:
#
#  - readability-magic-numbers / -identifier-length: noise that would demand
#    naming/literal churn unrelated to correctness.
#  - readability-implicit-bool-conversion / -braces-around-statements /
#    -isolate-declaration / -uppercase-literal-suffix: the C-ABI layer
#    intentionally uses `if (ptr)` null checks and single-statement ifs
#    throughout (~500 sites); rewriting the whole library is out of scope.
#  - readability-function-cognitive-complexity: rvcl_dispatch_matmul is 27
#    vs threshold 25; refactoring a dense dispatch path risks behavior change.
#  - bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters: many C ABI entry points take
#    several same-typed args by design (m/n/k, strides, dims).
#  - cert-err33-c: ignoring snprintf/printf/fclose return values is pervasive
#    and harmless in a C-ABI runtime; per-site NOLINT is low value.
#  - cert-err34-c: the bench parsers convert known-format input with
#    sscanf/atoi; acceptable for their contract.
#
# Kept and enforced (CI runs zero-warning on PR-diff files):
#  - bugprone-* (incl. narrowing/widening, branch-clone, realloc, leaks)
#  - cert-dcl50-cpp (C-style varargs; only the intentional printf-style
#    fatal helpers are NOLINT'd)
#  - readability-* minus the exclusions above, notably
#    readability-identifier-naming (the project-mandatory `_t` type suffix)
#  - clang-analyzer-* (the analyzer checks ship under the default umbrella)
---
Checks: >-
  bugprone-*,cert-*,readability-*,
  -readability-magic-numbers,
  -readability-identifier-length,
  -bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters,
  -readability-implicit-bool-conversion,
  -readability-braces-around-statements,
  -readability-uppercase-literal-suffix,
  -readability-isolate-declaration,
  -readability-function-cognitive-complexity,
  -cert-err33-c,
  -cert-err34-c
